  "id": "fixed-time-schedule",
  "term": "fixed-time schedule",
  "definition": "A fixed-time schedule is a feeding arrangement in which food is delivered at set times rather than being continuously available. In the described animal model, this timed food delivery is linked with reduced eating and increased wheel-running activity.",
